  "abstract": "Red Hat OpenStack Platform provides the facilities for building, deploying\nand monitoring a private or public infrastructure-as-a-service (IaaS) cloud\nrunning on commonly available physical hardware.\n\nChanges to the openstack-manila-ui component:\n\n* Previously, the OpenStack dashboard would not load the Shared File System's (Manila's) service pages as the dashboard integration files had the wrong permissions. The permissions have now been corrected. (BZ#1661395)\n\nChanges to the openstack-octavia-ui component:\n\n* Previously, the TERMINATED_HTTPS listener type was greyed out in the Horizon web interface. This listener type can now be selected in the Horizon web interface. (BZ#1686883)\n\nChanges to the python-openstackclient component:\n\n* The OpenStack client API adds a new command `openstack quota list --detail`. This command will return details about quota usage for your project. (BZ#1688227)\n\nChanges to the python-oslo-middleware component:\n\n* Previously, excessive deprecation warnings could be logged by the webob library due to the use of the best_match method. This method has been removed, cleaning these events from logs. (BZ#1700503)",
